{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14211440","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14211440","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1421144001:1":{"text":"ごめんね、オルデア。サリエ様があそこまで使えないとは思わなかったわ……","source_cn":"抱歉，欧蒂薇，我没想到沙利叶大人不靠谱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE422869859E29D5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1421144002:1":{"text":"いえ、使えないのは分かってたけど、予想を上回るポンコツだった……","source_cn":"不，我知道他是个不靠谱的人，但没想到他会这么不靠谱！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C4DF7C3D5B84D97","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1421144003:1":{"text":"隊長と同期だった隊員は、ほとんどいなくなったけど。探せば一人や二人は見つかるはずよ。","source_cn":"虽然跟因度厄同期的卫兵很多都找不到人了，但我努努力，还...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBEF8539D9D7AFA2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1421144004:1":{"text":"大丈夫ですよ、セレ！第三部もすでに完成しましたの！","source_cn":"啊，不必了，席蕾！我已经得到了灵感，并且写完了第三段故事！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF452205A5AC276DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1421144005:1":{"text":"まさか、隊長がお酒に弱いことや、酔っ払った時のことを書いたの？","source_cn":"你该不会就是写因度厄酒量差发酒疯这些东西吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0070D9E4AD11BECC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":